# SupersededPublicationRefused: the cutover is checked and its swap fenced on the captured source.
MODULE: SchemaRemediationCutover
ROW: SupersededPublicationRefused
FILE: src/lattice.schema/LatticeSchemaRemediationGrain.cs
DETECTORS: SchemaRemediationSupersededCutoverIntegrationTests.Cutover_after_the_alias_moved_to_another_tree_is_refused_with_no_swap_and_the_new_alias_intact
SUMMARY: the cutover swaps over whatever the tree resolves to (#5289)

--- FIND
        if (await SupersedingCopyAsync(sourcePhysical, destinationPhysical) is { } supersededBeforeCutover)
--- REPLACE
        if (sourcePhysical is null && await SupersedingCopyAsync(sourcePhysical, destinationPhysical) is { } supersededBeforeCutover)
--- END

--- FIND
                grainFactory, TreeId, destinationPhysical, expectedSourcePhysicalTreeId: sourcePhysical);
--- REPLACE
                grainFactory, TreeId, destinationPhysical, expectedSourcePhysicalTreeId: null);
--- END
